      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "We need to reframe Section 4.2 not as a hurdle, but as a strategic filter ensuring only the most innovative, high-impact companies receive the subsidy. I suggest we pitch it as a mechanism that elevates our local manufacturers to a global standard, attracting top-tier investment that benefits everyone. Furthermore, we can emphasize that this specific threshold guarantees the long-term sustainability of the sector, which is a direct win for his constituents' economic stability.",
